{#
  A post's body text, on its own so an edit can re-render exactly this and
  nothing else — swapping the whole card would throw away the reply thread
  the member had expanded underneath it.

  Plain text, never |raw. `autolink` (Core\View\TextLinker) escapes it
  first and only then builds anchors around the escaped spans, so nothing
  a member typed reaches the page as markup and the only tags in the
  output are the ones it built; it also does the job |nl2br used to do
  here, which is why the two are never combined. Rendered in one place so
  the feed and Controller\PostController::edit()'s own AJAX response can
  never disagree about that escaping.
#}
<p class="mb-0 mt-2 groups-post-body" id="post-body-{{ post.id }}">{{ post.body|autolink }}</p>
